# React Password Generator

A simple React.js application that generates secure, customizable passwords. Users can select password length and character types including numbers, letters, and symbols.

## Features

- Adjustable password length
- Toggle uppercase, lowercase, numbers, and symbols
- Copy password with a single click

## Setup

1. Clone the repository
2. Run `npm install`
3. Run `npm start` to launch the app

## Usage

Open the app in your browser, adjust your password options, and click generate.
